  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NDCP LT-LEDS_Climate Change_Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Project Initiation Plan is a part of the global UNDPs flagship initiative, the Climate Promise: From Pledge to Impact - Leveraging the Climate Promise to turn enhanced Nationally Determined Contributions (eNDC) into ambitious climate action. The project is aimed at supporting the climate goals of Ukraine, and is a pivotal element of UNDPs broader effort to assist the country in enhancing its Nationally Determined Contributions (NDCs) under the Paris Agreement, with a specific focus on inclusive and genderresponsive governance, as well as financing mechanisms to enable effective delivery and tracking of climate commitments across various sectors.Key to this initiative is the collaboration with the Ministry of Energy, Ministry of Environmental Protection and Natural Resources and other critical stakeholders (including NGO sector) to draft and enact legislation.</narrative>
  </description>
